{
  "comment": "risk-gated 分级验收语料（design §3/P1/P3）。改动规则表必须让本语料保持分组不变。",
  "ordinary": [
    "echo hello",
    "git status",
    "node -v",
    "pnpm run build",
    "ls -la",
    "git diff --check",
    "Get-Content file.txt -Encoding utf8",
    "echo install",
    "echo Stop-Computer"
